@startuml Quota_Billing_Flow
!theme blueprint
title Cramer CMS - Quota & Billing Flow

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor #1a1a2e
    TitleFontColor #ffffff
    TitleFontSize 20
    DefaultFontColor #e8e8e8
    ArrowColor #64b5f6
    ActorBackgroundColor #4caf50
    RectangleBackgroundColor #37474f
    RectangleBorderColor #78909c
    NoteBackgroundColor #424242
    NoteFontColor #ffffff
    StateBackgroundColor #2d2d44
}

actor "User" as User #lightgreen

rectangle "Frontend" {
    [useQuotaStore] as QuotaStore
    [QuotaDisplay] as QuotaUI
    [QuotaExceededModal] as QuotaModal
}

rectangle "Backend Services" {
    [QuotaController] as QuotaCtrl
    [QuotaBillingService] as BillingSvc
    [QuotaService] as QuotaSvc
    [CreditService] as CreditSvc
    [SubscriptionService] as SubSvc
}

database "Database" {
    [user_quotas]
    [skill_quotas]
    [user_credits]
    [user_subscriptions]
}

state "Billing Decision Flow" as Decision {
    state "Check Tier" as CheckTier
    state "Premium?" as IsPremium
    state "Within Cap?" as WithinCap
    state "Has Lua?" as HasLua
    state "Allowed (Free)" as AllowedFree
    state "Allowed (Charged)" as AllowedCharged
    state "Blocked" as Blocked
}

' Pre-check before starting test
User --> QuotaCtrl : GET /can-attempt?skill=READING&ai=false
QuotaCtrl --> BillingSvc : preCheckAttempt(userId, skill, isAI)

' Decision Flow
BillingSvc --> CheckTier
CheckTier --> IsPremium

IsPremium --> AllowedFree : Yes (cramerich/cramerous)
IsPremium --> WithinCap : No (cramerie)

WithinCap --> AllowedFree : Yes (under 20/skill/mo)
WithinCap --> HasLua : No (cap exceeded)

HasLua --> AllowedCharged : Yes (deduct Lua)
HasLua --> Blocked : No (insufficient)

' Response back
AllowedFree --> QuotaCtrl : {allowed: true, charge: 0}
AllowedCharged --> QuotaCtrl : {allowed: true, charge: 10/20}
Blocked --> QuotaCtrl : {allowed: false, reason: "..."}

QuotaCtrl --> QuotaStore : Update frontend state
QuotaStore --> QuotaUI : Display remaining
QuotaStore --> QuotaModal : Show if blocked

' Actual billing on attempt start
User --> BillingSvc : processAttemptBilling(userId, skill, isAI)
BillingSvc --> CreditSvc : deductCredits(userId, amount)
CreditSvc --> user_credits : Update balance
BillingSvc --> QuotaSvc : incrementQuota(userId, skill)
QuotaSvc --> skill_quotas : Increment count

note right of BillingSvc
  **QuotaBillingService Constants:**
  
  ATTEMPT_OVERAGE_COST = 10 Lua
  ATTEMPT_AI_OVERAGE_COST = 20 Lua
  
  **processAttemptBilling() Flow:**
  1. Premium users -> always allowed
  2. Check global + skill caps
  3. Cap hit -> charge Lua or block
  4. Within cap -> allowed, no charge
  5. Increment quota counts
end note

note left of Decision
  **Quota Caps (Cramerie):**
  - Global: 60 attempts/month
  - Per-Skill: 20 attempts/month
  - AI Gradings: 0/month (pay per use)
  
  **Premium Bypass:**
  - Cramerich: unlimited attempts
  - Cramerous: unlimited attempts
end note

note bottom of QuotaModal
  **QuotaExceededModal Actions:**
  - Buy Lua Pack
  - Upgrade Subscription
  - Use existing Lua balance
end note

@enduml
